    1-1.1  Iconify Toggle (1)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Iconifies/Un-Iconifies a node.


    1-1.2  Shut Down Node Immediately (2)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Shut down a node immeidately. Kicks users offline and shuts down as
    quickly as possible.


